000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SYNP000.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01 WS-STEP                         PIC X(16).
000600 COPY SYNPRM.
000700 COPY SYNERR.
000800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000900 MAIN-PROCESS.
001000     INITIALIZE SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS.
001100     PERFORM VALIDATE-REQUEST.
001200     IF RETURN-CODE = ZERO
001300         MOVE 'LOAD' TO WS-STEP
001400         CALL 'SYNP010' USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS
001500     END-IF.
001600     IF RETURN-CODE = ZERO
001700         MOVE 'ROUTE' TO WS-STEP
001800         CALL 'SYNP020' USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS
001900     END-IF.
002000     IF RETURN-CODE = ZERO
002100         MOVE 'BASE' TO WS-STEP
002200         CALL LK-CALCULATOR-PROGRAM
002300             USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS
002400     END-IF.
002500     IF RETURN-CODE = ZERO
002600         MOVE 'RIDER' TO WS-STEP
002700         CALL 'SYNP030' USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS
002800     END-IF.
002900     IF RETURN-CODE = ZERO
003000         MOVE 'ADJUST' TO WS-STEP
003100         CALL 'SYNP040' USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS
003200     END-IF.
003300     CALL 'SYNP090' USING SYN-PREMIUM-PARAMETERS.
